macro:dx = (X) { defer { X = 7i64; } };

// WHAT A `defer` DID, THE CODE AFTER ITS BLOCK INHERITS (DEF-525, HIGH by kind, landing 177d2b). A body in an inner block, an arm or a
// loop body runs when that block ends, and its state was thrown away, so `.value` of a `Result` it re-assigned read a zero with no
// sign (60/60), a read after its free read freed bytes (230/230), a read after its move hit the vacated slot (98/98). `k_` stayed
// refused and its report at its own place. `a_` attacks the widening: a binding a body assigned is assigned only if the body ran.
// `w_when_then_moves` and `w_when_end_moves` report the read alone since landing 177d2b2: a `then` or an `end` runs once (D-027), and so does the body of a loop that always breaks (`w_break_in_the_block_itself`), so the move isn't met twice.
// The price: `s_pick_arm_leaves_DEF524`, right at run time, since `mayacc` takes the arms that leave (DEF-524; its `if` twin stands).
// `s_widen_give_*` were refused until landing 177d2b2 and are `n_widen_give_*` in the program beside this file: a `give` runs the bodies of the blocks it leaves on its own road, so what they assign is assigned after the pick.
// NOT HERE: a body on a road leaving by `break` or `continue` through an `if` (DEF-429: `leave_carries_its_road.npk`, `jump_runs_its_defers.npk`), or by `fall` (DEF-437: `fall_carries_its_road.npk`).
